60/extras/c4b4de3e066b8137dade884d5b18f432.webm?t=1725004556\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1007960/extras/c4b4de3e066b8137dade884d5b18f432.mp4?t=1725004556\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Checklist - Create a checklist of tasks.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1007960/extras/89841d6ce49235af719822ddd0731d12.poster.avif?t=1725004556\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1007960/extras/89841d6ce49235af719822ddd0731d12.webm?t=1725004556\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1007960/extras/89841d6ce49235af719822ddd0731d12.mp4?t=1725004556\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Bookmark - Create a quick link to an app on your computer, or to a website.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1007960/extras/9642c05f92f2dec13ef495d143ba3258.poster.avif?t=1725004556\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1007960/extras/9642c05f92f2dec13ef495d143ba3258.webm?t=1725004556\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br>Group - Tap windows together to link them to show relationships.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1007960/extras/976d709c02b73f3c8a711d066da455a6.poster.avif?t=1725004556\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1007960/extras/976d709c02b73f3c8a711d066da455a6.webm?t=1725004556\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.ak